# Keep the Airflow image build context lean and reproducible (Phase 8b). data/ is
# gitignored working output — the container generates its own; never bake a stale
# tiny.duckdb. The venv, caches and VCS metadata are irrelevant to the image.
.git
data
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
dbt/target
dbt/logs
logs
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.claude

# Secrets must never be baked by `COPY . /opt/otr` (review round 1, #7). None are
# committed, but a developer's local file would otherwise enter the image and
# survive `down -v`. These mirror CLAUDE.md's never-commit list.
.env
.env.*
*.tfvars
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*-key.json
*-credentials.json
service-account*.json
**/credentials*
